cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this project, cite it as an educational QuestionSense prototype. Add contributor names and repository URL before publication."
title: "QuestionSense: Question Type Classification and Direct-Answer Prototype"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-10
abstract: >-
  QuestionSense is an educational NLP prototype that uses transparent wording
  rules to map English questions to six TREC coarse classes and a small separate
  answer lookup for demonstration questions. An optional TF-IDF plus Logistic
  Regression baseline is included for reproducible experimentation; it is not
  integrated into the current website classifier.
